			"notes": "**What's New?**\n- Now works for hotbar attack cooldown\n- Removed `Breaking Blocks`, `Disable Axe Attack Cooldown`, `Disable Pickaxe / Shovel Attack Cooldown` options\n- Added `Axe Cooldown`, `Pickaxe / Shovel Cooldown`, and `Hand / \"No-Cooldown\" Item Cooldown` options\n  - Have 4 values: `Attack`, `Mine`, `Both`, `Neither`\n  - If `Attack` or `Both`, then the normal weapon attack cooldown will show\n  - If `Mine` or `Both`, then when you break blocks with that item, the progress will show\n  - \"No-Cooldown\" Items are items that have the same cooldown as the hand\n\n**Why Beta?**\n- I was just about to release this as a normal release, but I just realized, that the change might actually be negative, as it limits the mining bar to, pickaxes, shovels, axes, \"No-Cooldown\" items, and empty hands. I did this change so I could add the No-Cooldown options without adding another option, which the screen doesn't have room for. But I think I'll probably revert this, as the only way to get around this new downside, would cause the same problem if I just added it from the beginning. So I'll have to think about this some more before creating a full release."
